  "text": "FAMILY WORKSPACE\nCare\nCaregivers\nMessages\nRequest care\nMB\nMaria Bennett\nFamily\nMy care\n/\nRecurring care\n\nRECURRING CARE\n\nRecurring care for Eleanor Bennett\n\nMon, Wed, Fri · 10:00 AM–12:00 PM · Raleigh, NC\n\nFinding a caregiver\nRequest #15\nGet help\nCare story\nOverview\nCaregivers\nVisits\nCare details\n\nREVIEW YOUR CHOICE\n\nHire Sofia Martinez for Eleanor Bennett\nCare\nRecurring care\nSchedule\nMon, Wed, Fri · 10:00 AM–12:00 PM\nLocation\n142 Maple Grove Lane, Apartment 2B, Raleigh, NC 27601\nCare rate\n$30.00/hour\n\nPlus $1.00/hour processing.\n\nAgreed care\n\nCompanionship, preparing lunch, and light housekeeping.\n\nCompanionship · Meal preparation · Light housekeeping\n\nPlease arrive on time and leave a short update after the visit.\n\nConfirming selects this caregiver, saves the care agreement and prepares card authorization. Other open applications will be marked not selected. Your recurring care home will show booked visits and any payment action needed.\n\nConfirm hire\nBack to caregivers\n\nCAREGIVER REPLIES\n\nReview replies below\n\nOpen profile details only when you need more context. The main actions stay on each caregiver card.\n\nInvite someone\nFilter or sort caregivers\n\n2 caregivers match the applicant filters\n\nCaregivers who replied\n\nReview their reply, profile, or start a conversation.\n\nSM\n\nSofia Martinez\n\nSaved\n\nRaleigh, NC\n\n7 years experience\n4.9\n24 reviews\nReliability 98%\nProfile details\n\nI would be happy to help Ellie with lunch, a little tidying, and conversation. I am available for your requested schedule.\n\nHire Sofia\nView profile\nOpen chat\nMore options for Sofia\nJW\n\nJames Wilson\n\nInterested\n\nRaleigh, NC\n\n5 years experience\n4.8\n18 reviews\nReliability 98%\nProfile details\n\nI would be happy to help Ellie with lunch, a little tidying, and conversation. I am available for your requested schedule.\n\nHire James\nView profile\nSave & chat\nMore options for James\n\nLOOKING FOR A SPECIFIC PERSON?\n\nInvite someone you know\n\nSearch by name and invite them without leaving this request or choosing the request again.\n\nSearch and invite\nPeople you invited\n\nInvitations are separate from caregivers who replied.\n\n0 total\nNo active invitations yet.\nRecommended caregivers\n\nKeep reviewing replies above, or invite another matching caregiver if no one feels right yet.\n\nAR\n\nAisha Robinson\n\nSame ZIP service area - Match score 128\n\n5.0\n31 reviews\nIdentity verified\nBackground check\nTop caregiver\n\nSame ZIP service area - Recurring match 100%\n\nInvite Aisha\nOC\n\nOliver Chen\n\nSame ZIP service area - Match score 128\n\n4.8\n12 reviews\nIdentity verified\nBackground check\nTop caregiver\n\nSame ZIP service area - Recurring match 100%\n\nInvite Oliver\nER\n\nE2E Ready Caregiver\n\nSame ZIP service area - Match score 118\n\n4.9\n14 reviews\nIdentity verified\nBackground check\nTop caregiver\nCPR\n · \nReported by caregiver\nMemory loss, dementia, or Alzheimer's support\nLimited mobility or fall-risk support\n\nSame ZIP service area - Recurring match 100%\n\nInvite E2E\n\n© 2026 LoLo Care Inc\n\n﻿\nTerms of Service\nPrivacy Policy\nPayments & Cancellation\nCaregiver Terms\nFamily Terms\nSafety Policy\nAll Legal Documents",
